        "resena": "The Batallón Policía Militar N° 111 originated from the Compañía de Policía Militar Nº 111, organized to provide security and disciplinary control for the Cuartel General of the former Primera Región Militar. It was subsequently elevated to battalion status to expand its protection, control, and support capabilities for the I División de Ejército. Its mission includes installation security, military traffic control, custody of personnel and materiel, and the maintenance of order and discipline. It is also trained to conduct crowd control, protect authorities, secure convoys, and support internal order operations. It reports directly to the I División de Ejército and is based in the city of Piura, alongside the facilities of its Cuartel General."
