        "nombre": "COMPAÑÍA COMUNICACIONES N° 21",
        "resena": "The Compañía de Comunicaciones Nº 21 was organized as a command-support unit of the 1ª Brigada Multipropósito. Its mission is to install, operate, and maintain the communications systems required for command and control of the Gran Unidad. It establishes links among the headquarters, battalions, companies, and other elements deployed during exercises and operations. During disasters, it ensures the timely exchange of information among search, rescue, engineer, healthcare, and logistics-support teams. Its headquarters is at Fuerte Militar General de División Rafael Hoyos Rubio, Rímac, Lima."
