        "resena": "The Compañía Comando Nº 3 is a small organic unit directly subordinate to the headquarters of the 3ª Brigada Blindada. It was organized to provide security, administrative support, and operating facilities to the brigade Command and Staff. Its mission includes establishing and protecting the command post, internal services, and support for command-and-control activities. Its headquarters is in Moquegua."
