      "en": {
        "nombre": "COMPAÑÍA POLICÍA MILITAR N° 4",
        "resena": "The Compañía de Policía Militar Nº 4 is a small organic unit directly subordinate to the 4ª Brigada de Montaña. It was organized to maintain discipline, order, and security in the facilities and areas under the Brigade’s responsibility. Its mission includes access control, protection of authorities, security of facilities, and regulation of military traffic. Its headquarters are in Puno."
      },
