        "resena": "The Escuadrón de Policía Militar Nº 20 is a small organic unit directly subordinate to the 3ª Brigada de Caballería. It was organized to maintain discipline, order, and security in the facilities and areas under the Brigade’s responsibility. Its mission includes access control, protection of authorities, security of facilities, and regulation of military traffic. Its headquarters are in Tacna."
