      "en": {
        "nombre": "COMPAÑÍA ESPECIAL DE COMANDOS N° 125",
        "resena": "The Compañía Especial de Comandos Nº 125 was organized to provide the V División de Ejército with a specialized immediate-intervention force. Its operational tradition is linked to deployments conducted in defense of the Amazonian border, particularly during the Conflicto del Cenepa. Its personnel receive specialized training in jungle operations, reconnaissance, infiltration, and military actions in difficult-to-access terrain. It is known by the name “Otorongo”. Its headquarters are in guarnición de Otorongo, in the city of Iquitos, región Loreto."
      },
      "qu": {
        "nombre": "COMPAÑÍA ESPECIAL DE COMANDOS N° 125",
        "resena": "la intervención kallpata qunanpaq kamarisqa karqan. Operacional tradiciónninqa Amazonía fronterata amachananpaq desplieguekunawan t'inkisqa, aswanpas Conflicto del Cenepa pachapi. Personalnin sacha operaciones, reconocimiento, infiltración hinallataq sasa chayanapaq allpakunapi acciones militares nisqakunata ruwananpaq especial yachachiyta chaskin. “Otorongo” sutichawan riqsisqa. Sedenmi Otorongo guarnición, Iquitos, Loreto llaqtapi kachkan."
      }
    }
  },
