        "resena": "The Destacamento Aerotransportado was created in May 2025 as a new elite Major Unit of the Ejército del Perú. It is subordinate to the II DE and is intended to provide an immediate-response force with high strategic mobility. It consists of Batallón de Infantería Aerotransportado Nº 39, Batallón de Infantería Aeromóvil Nº 40, and Batallón de Fuerzas Especiales Nº 41. Its personnel receive specialized training in military parachuting, airmobile operations, special combat, and rapid deployments. Its mission includes intervention in crisis scenarios, special operations, and actions in hard-to-reach areas of the national territory. It is headquartered in Lima."
