        "resena": "The Cia AT N° 1 was organized to provide antitank defense for the 1ª Brigada de Infantería; the public sources consulted do not specify its exact date of creation.\n\nIts mission is to destroy or neutralize enemy armored vehicles and protect the positions, avenues of approach, and sectors assigned to the brigade.\n\nIts personnel train in armored-vehicle recognition, position selection, the employment of antitank weapons, and fire coordination with maneuver units.\n\nBecause of its border location, it participates in tactical exercises, border surveillance, and operational readiness activities in the department of Tumbes.\n\nIt is an organic unit of the 1.ª Brigada de Infantería of the I División de Ejército and is based at Fuerte “Zarumilla,” province of Zarumilla."
