        "resena": "An organic battalion of the 1ª Brigada de Selva de Protección de la Amazonía, formerly the 6ª Brigada de Selva, under the I División de Ejército.\n\nIt was organized and trained to conduct decentralized surveillance, reconnaissance, and combat operations in the challenging Amazon jungle environment.\n\nThe battalion participated in the 1995 Conflicto del Cenepa. After the conflict, it continued to protect the Peruvian–Ecuadorian border through land and river patrols, particularly in hard-to-reach sectors.\n\nIts current headquarters is at the Ciro Alegría garrison, district of Nieva, province of Condorcanqui, Amazonas region."
