      "en": {
        "nombre": "GRUPO DE ARTILLERÍA DE CAMPAÑA “QHAPACÑAN”",
        "resena": "N° 521\n\nIt was created on January 1, 1974, pursuant to Decreto Supremo Nº 047-73/GU of December 3, 1973.\n\nBy RM N.º 2452-73-GU/DIRODIN, it received the honorary designation GAC “Sargento Mayor Fermín Nacarino” N° 121.\n\nIt was activated in Arequipa as an organic unit of the then Tercera Región Militar, where it remained until April 1975.\n\nFollowing the redesignation of GAC N° 121, it became GAC “Qhapacñan” N° 521.\n\nIt was established to strengthen the fire-support capability of the Agrupamiento de Artillería “Coronel José Joaquín Inclán”.\n\nIt has participated in field exercises and actions supporting the population, particularly during fires, floods, and other emergencies in Piura.\n\nIts headquarters is at Cuartel Inclán, Piura."
