        "resena": "The Batallón de Infantería Blindado Nº 57 bears the name of Colonel Víctor Fajardo García, a Peruvian hero of the Guerra del Pacífico.\n\nIt is a unit directly subordinate to the III División de Ejército and specializes in infantry operations using armored vehicles.\n\nIts organization enables it to combine mobility, protection, and firepower in offensive and defensive operations.\n\nIts mission includes defending strategic objectives, territorial control, and supporting major units deployed in southern Peru.\n\nIt also participates in actions supporting the population and responding to rainfall, flooding, and other emergencies in Arequipa.\n\nIts headquarters is at Fuerte Salaverry, Arequipa."
