        "resena": "The Batallón de Tanques Nº 212 was created by Decreto Supremo of July 10, 1968, and officially activated on January 1, 1969. By Resolución Ministerial Nº 1031-69 GU/AG of May 19, 1969, it received the historical name of coronel José de los Ríos. On February 5, 1975, it participated in operations to restore public order during the police mutiny in Lima. In May of that year, it was transferred to Arequipa and, amid border tensions, deployed a tank company to Chapolla and Chapollita. Beginning in 1986, it took part in counterinsurgency operations in southern Peru, demonstrating its ability to adapt to different operational environments. Its headquarters are at Fuerte «Arica», distrito de Locumba, región Tacna."
