        "resena": "It was created by Orden Ministerial Nº 09 H-1 of November 1987 and officially activated on January 1, 1988.\n\nIts original designation was Batallón de Ingeniería de Combate Blindado Nº 241, although it is currently listed as Batallón de Ingeniería de Combate Nº 241. During the national pacification process, it conducted patrols, civic actions, and support work in communities affected by terrorist violence.\n\nIt participated in the construction of the carretera Ayacucho–Cangallo, rehabilitation of the vía Andahuaylas–Abancay, and expansion of the aeropuerto de Santa Teresita.\n\nIt also took part in the Plan de Emergencia Vial Nacional de 1995 and continues to provide support during landslides, floods, and other emergencies.\n\nIt is stationed in the provincia de Andahuaylas, región Apurímac."
