        "nombre": "COMPAÑÍA COMUNICACIONES “ CHASQUI”  N° 5",
        "resena": "Formerly Cia Com N° 114, the Compañía de Comunicaciones «Chasqui» N.º 5 is a small organic unit of the 5ª Brigada de Montaña.\n\nIt was organized to provide secure, continuous links between the Command, Staff, and subordinate units of the Brigade.\n\nIts mission includes installing, operating, and maintaining radio systems, data networks, and other means intended for command and control.\n\nDuring operations, it establishes communications centers and ensures links in mountainous terrain and hard-to-reach areas.\n\nIts personnel specialize in telecommunications, information technology, communications security, and field equipment maintenance.\n\nIts headquarters are in Cusco."
