        "resena": "It was created on January 1, 1974, in guarnición de Arequipa under the initial designation Batallón de Ingeniería de Combate Mecanizado N.º 6. In 1976, it received number 20 and was incorporated as an organic unit of Destacamento «Tacna».\n\nAt the end of 1978, it was reorganized as Batallón de Ingeniería de Combate Blindado, a designation it retains today.\n\nBy Resolución Ministerial Nº 1805-77 GU/AG of August 24, 1977, it received the name of subteniente Jorge Montenegro Gasco.\n\nThe unit has contributed to the construction and maintenance of military facilities in Tacna and has carried out civic-action and disaster-prevention works.\n\nIts headquarters are at cuartel «Coronel Gregorio Albarracín» in ciudad de Tacna."
