        "nombre": "COMPAÑÍA ANTITANQUE “MY CAB GERMAN PARRA DEL CARPIO”",
        "resena": "The Compañía Antitanque Nº 646 is a small organic unit of the Agrupamiento Antitanque «Cazadores» Nº 3 of the III División de Ejército.\n\nIt is named after then-capitán EP Germán Parra del Carpio, who served at Base Militar Unión Mantaro, in the VRAEM.\n\nHe was killed in action on February 16, 2012, by a terrorist sniper during reconnaissance operations in Huanta, Ayacucho.\n\nThe company performs antitank defense, protects strategic areas, and neutralizes enemy armored vehicles.\n\nIts principal armament includes the Israeli Spike-LR guided antitank missile system, equipped with electro-optical observation and guidance devices.\n\nIts headquarters are in Ite, departamento de Tacna."
