        "resena": "The Compañía Especial de Comandos “Lince” Nº 2 is an organic unit of the 2.ª Brigada de Infantería.\n\nWith more than four decades of existence, it was organized to conduct special operations, reconnaissance, and direct actions in difficult-to-access areas.\n\nIt has actively participated in the fight against remnants of Sendero Luminoso and organizations linked to drug trafficking in the VRAEM.\n\nIn July 2022, it participated in operación “Próceres” in Vizcatán del Ene, where SO3 EP Macario Pacco Quispe was killed in combat.\n\nIts headquarters are at Fuerte Pichari, distrito de Pichari, provincia de La Convención, región Cusco."
