        "resena": "N° 125\n\nThe Compañía Especial de Comandos Nº 125 was organized to provide the V División de Ejército with a specialized immediate-intervention force.\n\nIts operational tradition is linked to deployments conducted in defense of the Amazonian border, particularly during the Conflicto del Cenepa.\n\nIts personnel receive specialized training in jungle operations, reconnaissance, infiltration, and military actions in difficult-to-access terrain. It is known by the name “Otorongo”.\n\nIts headquarters are in guarnición de Otorongo, in the city of Iquitos, región Loreto."
