        "nombre": "COMPAÑÍA DE INTELIGENCIA N° 21",
        "resena": "The Compañía de Inteligencia N° 21 “Capitán Marco Ayala Galván” is a specialized tactical unit subordinate to the II División de Ejército, headquartered at Fuerte Militar General de División Rafael Hoyos Rubio in Rímac, Lima.\n\nIts primary mission is the collection, processing, analysis, and timely dissemination of military intelligence to support the planning and execution of operations across Peru's central region.\n\nIts highly trained personnel specialize in tactical intelligence, surveillance, reconnaissance, military counterintelligence, and operational analysis, serving as an essential early warning asset for the Command of the II División de Ejército."
